# Far Fortune, End Boss ({2}{B}{R}): the Max speed damage replacement. Bot1 casts it on turn one and bolts Bot2 on turns one, three and five; each is the first life
# Bot2 loses on that turn of Bot1's, so the speed goes 1, 2, 3, then 4 (CR 702.179a, 702.179d). Each of those Bolts deals a plain 3 as it is dealt (Bot2 at 17, 14, 11):
# below speed 4 the ability does not apply (CR 702.178a).
# At speed 4 on turn five: a second Bolt on Bot2's Dune Beetle (1/4) deals 3 plus 1 = 4 and kills it, which 3 would not; Far Fortune's attack trigger
# deals 1 plus 1 = 2 (Bot2 at 9); and the unblocked Far Fortune deals 4 plus 1 = 5 combat damage (Bot2 at 4).
# The bonus is only for sources Bot1 controls: Bot2's own Bolt on turn six deals Bot1 exactly 3 (Bot1 at 17).

